license: MIT
keywords:
  - plate tectonics
  - Southeast Asia
  - GPlates
  - animation
  - geoscience
  - Python
abstract: >-
  A Python tool for creating high-quality animations of 
  Southeast Asia's tectonic evolution from 240 million years 
  ago to the present day using the GPlately library and 
  plate reconstruction models from EarthByte.
